<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB 13-week bill yield unchanged at 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB 13-week bill yield unchanged at 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in the Czech National Bank's (CNB) auction on Thursday of five billion crowns worth of 13 week liquidity bills hit 13.5 percent, the same as in the last auction of similar bills on October 10, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The closest rate on the Prague interbank market, the three-month PRIBOR, averaged 12.73 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>			     Oct 24		   Oct 10</p>
<p> Offered amount (bln)   5.000		    8.000</p>
<p> Bids			 3.510		    4.943</p>
<p> Accepted bids	    3.510		    4.943</p>
<p> Gross yield (pct)     13.500		   13.500</p>
<p> Net yield (pct)	 10.125		   10.125</p>
<p> Date of issue	   Oct 25		   Oct 11</p>
<p> Date of maturity	Jan 24		   Jan 10</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
